msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Edit Keys on Path: add keyframe handles to the bones / objects selected now (like Calculate Path: selecting other bones later adds nothing; use Add Selected). Drag: move one key. Shift+click: add keys. Shift+drag: move the selected keys together. Click again to stop editing"
msgstr "在路径上编辑关键帧：为当前选中的骨骼/物体添加关键帧控制柄（类似计算路径：之后再选其他骨骼不会添加，请使用「添加所选」）。拖动：移动一个关键帧。Shift+点击：添加关键帧。Shift+拖动：一起移动所选关键帧。再次点击停止编辑"

