#: Motion Path Pro/__init__.py:570
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Insert Keys on Path: click a point on the motion path of a selected bone / object to key all of its transform channels (location, rotation, scale) on that frame. Stays on until you press Stop Inserting Keys"
msgstr "在路径上插入关键帧：点击所选骨骼/物体运动路径上的点，在该帧为它的所有变换通道（位置、旋转、缩放）插入关键帧。一直保持，直到按下「停止插入关键帧」"

